WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:10.270
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:28.120
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:37.800
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.490
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.430
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:53.420
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:59.120
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:04.790
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.430
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:14.270
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.240
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.310
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:29.050
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:33.780
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:40.290
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.390
From the great whole is born the two rites.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.760
From the two rites come the four emblems.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:49.670
From the four emblems come
the eight signs of divination.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:52.470
From the eight signs come
the sixty-four great signs.

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:58.780
However, I force open the mingling
of them and join together the 364.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:02.080
The suitability of the four gods we
send out this evening becomes one.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.750
The sixty-four signs in an array of 364.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:13.150
Sis!

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.010
Sis...

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.900
It'll be over... soon.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.470
Episode 14
MEMORY OF THE STARS

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:38.590
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:41.450
Right, right! I'm coming!

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.230
Um, who are you, sir?

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:48.490
Are you Itsuki Iba, Astral's president?

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:50.320
Um, yes.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.830
I'm Kei Isurugi. How do you do?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.600
Um, right... Are you a client?

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.870
I might be. The Association referred me to you.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:04.410
I've come to hire Astral's rental
magica for a star festival.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.270
"Star festival"?

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.870
You don't know about it?

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.520
You're Astral's president, aren't you?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.010
Yeah, well...

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:13.680
A wasted trip.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.050
Genbu! Byakko! Suzaku! Seiryu!

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:21.020
What's with you guys?

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.350
Didn't I tell you to leave any visitors alone?

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:30.030
Well, I suppose the sheer cuteness of
cats lets them be forgiven for anything.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.740
Cats are freedom! Cats are justice!
Cats are without sin!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.300
So long as cats exist,
they fill the world with light-

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:38.980
You!

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:42.740
I see you haven't changed, Nekoyashiki.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.830
Mr. President, are you all right?

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:57.720
Yeah...

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.100
You shouldn't look too much.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.530
To look is also to be seen.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.770
All the more true for your eye, sir.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.210
Is this mountain really that bad?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.310
There's a lot of stagnant spell power here.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.980
I can see why The Association wants
it purified with a star festival.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:24.330
You don't need a really big ceremony
just to clear away spell power,

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.830
but to restore stagnant spell power that's...

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.590
...on the verge of becoming spell wave
contamination to its proper flow,

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.790
there are protocols you have to follow.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:37.260
In this case, a star festival
is the proper procedure.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.610
Um, Nekoyashiki?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:40.430
Yes?

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:41.400
Look...

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:46.940
Just what is your relationship with Mr. Isurugi?

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:52.350
No, it's okay. Never mind about it. I just-

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.050
It would commonly be referred
to as being brother pupils...

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.560
A long time ago, we both attended
the same school of Onmyoudou.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:03.360
I was officially the senior
and he was my junior, but...

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.060
So, that guy is an Onmyouji, too?

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:07.230
Yes.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:12.240
The next bit may sound sort of like a soliloquy...

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:17.570
Three years ago, I came to this
mountain to perform a star festival.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.410
Huh?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:22.710
At that time, a school of Onmyouji
controlled this mountain.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:26.320
A pupil who was being eyed as
the next successor to the school...

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.310
...was tasked with performing a star festival.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:32.960
But, at the last moment, the pupil ran away.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:38.360
Left with no choice,
another successor finished the ceremony.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:42.400
Rumor had it that the ceremony had failed,

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.370
and the mountain suffered
spell wave contamination.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.900
As a result of the scandal,
the school was closed.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.440
And the Onmyouji who completed the festival...

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.340
...lost her life.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.650
Nekoyashiki, was that?

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.420
Someone else, Mr. President.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.220
Where have you been?!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.520
I finished the purification a while ago!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.250
Brother Pres, if you're tired now,
what are you going to do later?

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.030
We have a lot of work ahead of us!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.100
Right, right...

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.750
Please stand back for now.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:31.980
R-Right.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.120
Genbu, Suzaku, Byakko, Seiryu.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:42.020
One becomes two, two becomes four.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:46.060
Four becomes eight, eight becomes sixteen.

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:48.600
From the great whole is born the two rites.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.430
From the two rites come the four emblems.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:52.730
From the four emblems come
the eight signs of divination.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:56.070
From the eight signs come
the sixty-four great signs.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.650
Wow...
However, I force open the mingling
of them and join together the 364.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.110
However, I force open the mingling
of them and join together the 364.

00:06:58.110 --> 00:06:59.980
Being able to manipulate spell power...
However, I force open the mingling
of them and join together the 364.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.880
...more finely than any other magical art...
However, I force open the mingling
of them and join together the 364.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:02.220
...is a specialty of Onmyoudou mysticism.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:04.590
...is a specialty of Onmyoudou mysticism.
The suitability of the four gods we
send out this evening becomes one.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.550
Amazing...
The suitability of the four gods we
send out this evening becomes one.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:09.220
And then only someone of Nekoyashiki's skill...
The sixty-four signs in an array of 364.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.250
...can manipulate spell power to this extent.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.330
That technique!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:34.610
Realm of Heaven, Realm of Earth, Realm of man!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.260
Nekoyashiki!

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.180
Snow?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.480
Where?

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:16.480
Mikan...

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:20.660
But, she's younger than she is now.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:23.720
Does that mean this is the past?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.830
So, what are you going to do with her?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.600
Who is this?

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:35.730
This is rare for you,
meddling with a stranger like that.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.840
Although, if she were a cat, you'd
always do something like this.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:44.420
Your silence is cruel, you know.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.090
That's why Kei can't stand you.

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:52.820
I suppose that's the flip side
of how much he admires you...

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:59.030
Still, you can't bring her back.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:02.540
Because she's a daughter of the Katsuragi clan.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:07.800
A small school like ours would be
destroyed by them in an instant.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.440
I...

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.340
I can just be excommunicated, can't I?

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:18.480
If I do that, at the very least, it'll
avoid a problem for the school itself.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:25.050
Then who will carry out the star festival here?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:30.420
I can do it, I suppose.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.230
Hm?

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:33.930
As much as I don't want to...

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.140
Sakuya...

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:36.230
I'm kidding.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:41.170
I, Sakuya Isurugi, shall perform the star festival.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.810
Our master will be angry about it, though.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:47.480
He's been grooming you to be his
successor since you came here.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.910
Anyway, what are you going to do with her?

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:55.190
I was thinking of taking her to Astral.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:58.550
The place that had that alchemist Judaix?

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:06.330
Yes, although the organization itself
still exists, and it's still registered.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:09.800
Well, in return, promise me something.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.040
That you...

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.240
Huh?

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:22.940
Ow!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:25.410
That was with your claws, not your foot pads!

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:27.920
What just happened?

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:30.520
Mikan!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:31.920
Mikan!

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.120
Brother Pres...

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.090
Thank goodness!

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.360
I'm glad you're okay, too.

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.870
You protected me, didn't you?

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.470
Thank you.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:49.700
I reverently ask the lord of Mt. Taizan,
quickly send forth a star of submission to me.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:53.740
Wolf that devours the bright sun in the heavens,
great gate of the moon spirit in the heavens.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.050
Honest man who knows
happiness in the heavens,

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.950
words and songs of the entry
hall that saves the heavens.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.890
Purity of birds and red origins in the heavens,

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:01.720
arctic song in the heart of the heavens.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.190
Army which smashes the gates of the heavens!

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.090
Nekoyashiki!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.290
Is Mikan all right?

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:07.320
Yes!

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.490
Forgive me, Mr. President.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.300
It seems I've involved you
in my personal affairs.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:13.730
It's all right.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:17.140
Mr. President, may I ask a favor of you?

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:18.730
A fehde...

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:22.040
I'd like you to serve as a
witness to a magical duel.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:24.440
A duel?! W-With who?

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:26.800
Kei Isurugi.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:32.010
Until I settle things with him,
this star festival will not be completed.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:32.910
But!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:35.020
Only you,

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:39.290
the president of a registered magical
association, can act as a witness to this.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:44.800
I understand.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.130
I will act as your witness.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:51.170
And if it's my job to do so,
I'll watch as well as I can.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:54.640
Thank you.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:03.250
Hello, Astral.

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:05.410
Nekoyashiki was right.

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:08.680
So, Kei Isurugi is...

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:13.790
I only skimmed the clinical chart,
but there's no doubt about it.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.560
Sakuya Isurugi, the one who received
spell wave contamination...

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:18.530
...during the star festival, died as a result.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:21.960
Kei Isurugi also absorbed some of
the stagnant spell power there.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:28.970
Modern medicine can't cure it, but they
are able to treat the surface symptoms.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.280
Not much comfort, is it?

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:35.000
It's amazing he can walk around looking so calm.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.750
He could drop dead at any moment.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.520
That's what makes him
such a terrific mage now.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.890
He doesn't fear any opponent. He's ready to die.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:01.200
Oh, it's you. Are you still here?

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:04.870
Kei!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:08.780
Kei, are you okay?

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:09.910
Leave me alone!

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:17.780
Anyway, is Nekoyashiki still breathing?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.720
That was your doing?

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:22.390
Yeah. I was the one who interfered.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.630
You're trying to get revenge for your sister?

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:27.530
Your sister...

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:32.030
Sakuya chose to perform the star festival herself.

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.370
Nekoyashiki didn't pressure her to do it.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:41.010
I understand that Nekoyashiki wasn't to blame.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:44.780
But... I still don't buy it!

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:49.490
If he hadn't disappeared,
my sister wouldn't have died.

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.690
That's the truth,

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:53.990
and I wouldn't suffer so much
if I could accept...

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:56.930
...people saying I'm being illogical
or misplacing the blame!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.600
That's why this problem is
between me and Nekoyashiki.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.440
It's none of your business!

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.200
You're wrong!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:07.370
I'm the company president and
Nekoyashiki is my employee,

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:09.070
so that makes it my business!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:13.510
Then what will you do? Take me on yourself?

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:14.610
No!

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:24.980
You intended to draw the spell power
I was releasing into yourself, didn't you?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.530
From the beginning, that was your intention...

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:30.000
...and the reason you requested
Astral perform the star festival.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.990
Yes, that's right.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.700
That's because our school's star festival...

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.330
...wasn't originally intended
for purifying spell power.

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:38.060
Huh?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.710
It purifies and gets stagnant
spell power moving again,

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:43.700
and then draws that power into the practitioner.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:50.170
It imbues them with life energy which is
then adapted for higher-level magic use.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.880
That was the original purpose of the star festival.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:56.590
The spell power would flow into his body?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:15:00.720
When it did, it would give the
recipient enormous power.

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:04.570
You weren't a possible successor to the school,

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.160
so you were never taught how
to do the ceremony yourself.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:10.700
Your only option was to get me to do it,

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:15.660
interrupt, and then seize the
spell power for yourself.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.050
You predicted that I'd do it?

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:21.810
We could have all been killed!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:23.280
Sorry about that.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.920
You've really changed.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:28.020
Yeah.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.550
I'm not the guy you once knew.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:33.190
I look forward to seeing that.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:39.330
Mikan, take Genbu and the others and
continue the star festival, please.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:40.490
Um, right.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.740
You're going to have them do the
star festival while we fight?

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:50.170
I don't mind handicapping myself.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:53.850
Don't think I'll leave even
a splinter of your soul!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.750
Mr. President, if you please.

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:56.610
Right.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.520
Fire overcomes water, so mote it be!

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:16.630
I summon the black dragon!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:25.300
I see.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:27.770
You combine techniques in battle, don't you?

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:30.480
He's as strong as he ever was.

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:34.450
What? Are you happy about this?

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:46.590
You!

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:50.430
If you won't attack, then I will.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:54.930
Realm of Heaven, Realm of Earth, Realm of man!

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:57.140
By my faith in the sign of the ram,

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.680
heavenly fox, earth fox, sky fox,
fox of red and fox of white!

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:01.650
The eight spirits and five gods of the fox god Inari!

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:04.140
I recite the secret text of Inari!

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.180
Kuda-gitsune!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:12.190
You've chosen five colors to
correspond with the five elements.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:17.100
That allows you to summon more than
your power normally would allow,

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.000
but it's highly unorthodox.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.930
Whatever works, I'll use,
be it Inari worship or whatever.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:24.930
Who cares what the method is?

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:25.900
Now go!

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.070
Return!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.920
Why... are you smiling?

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:45.920
Strong. So strong!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.020
Even now, he's still too powerful
for me to ever hope to match.

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:52.760
Well then, I'll!

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.710
Devour me!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:16.410
You've given your own body
to the kuda-gitsune?!

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:18.220
Yes.

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:22.660
I've sacrificed myself to them...
to gain their power!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:24.820
That's!

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:27.570
The fox thrust Dakiniten technique!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.300
Nekoyashiki!

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.700
If I take this off, I can help Nekoyashiki.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:36.400
But!

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.480
Nekoyashiki!

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:51.520
Don't!

00:18:52.890 --> 00:18:56.120
This is a fehde between Nekoyashiki and Kei!

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:58.130
Both of you, move back!

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.660
I knew I could count on you, Mr. President.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.570
It's time we ended this.

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.780
Beasts fear fire.

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.910
Even so, this is...

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.190
Even Nekoyashiki is in danger doing this!

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:24.150
Why would he go that far?

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:37.800
Evil Star Smash!

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:58.050
Kei!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.760
So strong...

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:12.030
I see... Revenge was just my excuse.

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:17.570
I just wanted to surpass you,
if only for a moment...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:32.890
Now then, we have to treat him.

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:34.180
You can cure him?!

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:36.800
Don't you think if you'd have
told him that in the first place,

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:38.890
he wouldn't have gone so far?

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.770
Where's the fun in that?

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:44.170
I'm kidding.

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.830
He had a legitimate reason to hate me.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:51.840
I had to face him down,
man to man, just this once.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:06.690
Wow!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:07.930
Is this?

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:09.560
An aurora.

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.060
How beautiful.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:17.700
Mr. President, thank you for witnessing
the duel to the very end.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:18.500
Huh?

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:22.570
Well, it's part of my job as
company president, isn't it?

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:30.620
Well, in return, promise me something.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.620
That you...

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:37.720
That you'll never abandon Kei.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.760
I kept my promise to you, Sakuya.

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:07.950
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:16.350
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:29.410
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:41.320
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:47.590
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.660 --> 00:22:52.100
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:56.370
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:01.470
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:13.340
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:17.390
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:21.630
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:24.600
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:26.900
Onmyoudou [ONMYOUDOU]

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:28.640
Onmyoudou [ONMYOUDOU]
That's the magic that
Nekoyashiki practices, right?

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:28.800
Onmyoudou [ONMYOUDOU]
He can use Shikigami, throw charms,
and do all sorts of things.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:31.940
He can use Shikigami, throw charms,
and do all sorts of things.

00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:34.570
I feel like nothing is impossible as
long as Nekoyashiki is with us.

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:37.740
Oh, but the idea of all-purpose
magic is just a fool's dream.

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:38.780
Prof. Miwa, what sort of magic do you practice?

